<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#051710">
<title>SINGHA — La Leyenda en Movimiento</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect x='10' y='10' width='12' height='12' fill='%23d9a83f' transform='rotate(45 16 16)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net" crossorigin>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/css/cinzel@latest/latin.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/css/archivo@latest/latin.css" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --green-950:#051710;
  --green-900:#082418;
  --green-800:#0d3323;
  --gold:#d9a83f;
  --gold-bright:#f2cd6b;
  --cream:#f4ecd8;
  --red:#b23a30;
  --p:0;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:auto}
body{
  background:var(--green-950);
  color:var(--cream);
  font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;
  overflow-x:hidden;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
}
::selection{background:var(--gold);color:var(--green-950)}

/* ============ ESCENARIO (VIDEO FIJO) ============ */
.stage{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;overflow:hidden;background:var(--green-950)}
.stage video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transform:translateZ(0);backface-visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none}
.stage-fallback{
  position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;transition:opacity 1s;
  background:
    radial-gradient(1100px 750px at 72% 18%, rgba(217,168,63,.30), transparent 62%),
    radial-gradient(900px 700px at 18% 82%, rgba(178,58,48,.22), transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(1500px 1100px at 50% 50%, #0d3323, #051710 72%);
  filter:hue-rotate(calc(var(--p) * 28deg)) saturate(calc(1 + var(--p) * .35));
}
body.no-video .stage-fallback{opacity:1}
body.no-video .stage video{display:none}
.tint{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,23,16,.62),rgba(5,23,16,.16) 26%,rgba(5,23,16,.14) 62%,rgba(5,23,16,.74))}
.vignette{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(125% 92% at 50% 45%,transparent 52%,rgba(3,12,8,.8))}
.grain{
  position:absolute;inset:-50%;opacity:.07;mix-blend-mode:overlay;pointer-events:none;
  background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='160' height='160'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='2'/></filter><rect width='160' height='160' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.6'/></svg>");
  animation:grain 7s steps(8) infinite;
}
@keyframes grain{
  0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0)}
  20%{transform:translate(-3%,2%)}
  40%{transform:translate(2%,-3%)}
  60%{transform:translate(-2%,-2%)}
  80%{transform:translate(3%,3%)}
}

/* ============ UI FIJA ============ */
.topfade{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:120px;z-index:15;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(4,15,10,.85),transparent);pointer-events:none}
.progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;z-index:30;background:rgba(244,236,216,.08)}
#progressFill{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),var(--gold-bright));transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(0);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(217,168,63,.7);will-change:transform}
.topbar{
  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:20;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  padding:1.05rem clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;
}
.brand{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;color:var(--cream);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.34em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7em}
.brand i{width:9px;height:9px;background:var(--gold);transform:rotate(45deg);display:inline-block;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(217,168,63,.9);transition:transform .5s}
.brand:hover i{transform:rotate(225deg)}
.top-right{display:flex;gap:1.8em;align-items:center;color:rgba(244,236,216,.72)}
#chapterLabel{color:var(--gold);transition:opacity .28s;max-width:40vw;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.timecode{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:.14em}
@media(max-width:640px){.timecode{display:none}}

.dots{position:fixed;right:clamp(.8rem,2vw,1.6rem);top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:20;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:15px}
.dots button{position:relative;width:10px;height:10px;border:1px solid rgba(217,168,63,.6);background:transparent;transform:rotate(45deg);cursor:pointer;transition:background .35s,transform .35s,box-shadow .35s;padding:0}
.dots button:hover{background:rgba(217,168,63,.45);transform:rotate(45deg) scale(1.3)}
.dots button.act{background:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(217,168,63,.9);transform:rotate(45deg) scale(1.4)}
.dots button::after{
  content:attr(data-label);position:absolute;right:26px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%) rotate(-45deg);transform-origin:right center;
  font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cream);
  background:rgba(5,23,16,.9);border:1px solid rgba(217,168,63,.35);padding:.5em .9em;white-space:nowrap;
  opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s;pointer-events:none;
}
.dots button:hover::after{opacity:1}
@media(max-width:860px){.dots{display:none}}

.hint{
  position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:1.5rem;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:20;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;
  font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.36em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(244,236,216,.85);transition:opacity .5s;white-space:nowrap;
}
.hint .mouse{width:1px;height:46px;background:rgba(244,236,216,.22);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hint .mouse::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:-45%;width:100%;height:45%;background:var(--gold);animation:drip 1.7s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes drip{to{top:115%}}
.hint.hide{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}

.idx{
  position:fixed;left:clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem);bottom:1.3rem;z-index:20;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.7em;
  font-family:'Cinzel',serif;letter-spacing:.3em;color:rgba(244,236,216,.75);opacity:0;transition:opacity .5s;
}
.idx.show{opacity:1}
.idx b{font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
.idx span{font-size:.62rem;font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.3em}
@media(max-width:640px){.idx{display:none}}

/* ============ PISTAS / SECCIONES ============ */
#track{position:relative;z-index:2}
.panel{
  min-height:100vh;min-height:100svh;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  padding:14vh clamp(1.2rem,6vw,7rem);
}
.inner{position:relative;z-index:3;max-width:640px;width:100%}
.panel.right .inner{margin-left:auto}

.ghost{
  position:absolute;z-index:1;top:50%;right:-2vw;transform:translateY(-50%);
  font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(9rem,27vw,23rem);line-height:1;
  color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px rgba(217,168,63,.22);
  user-select:none;pointer-events:none;will-change:transform;
}
.panel.right .ghost{right:auto;left:-2vw}

.kicker{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1em;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.42em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.kicker::before{content:"";width:46px;height:1px;background:var(--gold);flex:none}
h2{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5.6vw,4.4rem);line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:1.35rem;text-wrap:balance}
h2 .gold{color:var(--gold)}
.lead{font-size:clamp(1rem,1.3vw,1.13rem);line-height:1.8;color:rgba(244,236,216,.87);max-width:56ch}
.note{margin-top:1.7rem;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.2em;color:rgba(217,168,63,.9);text-transform:uppercase;display:flex;gap:.9em;align-items:center}
.note::before{content:"◆";font-size:.6em;color:var(--red)}
.thai{font-size:1.05rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:none;color:var(--gold-bright)}

.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(46px);transition:opacity .95s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),transform .95s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);transition-delay:var(--d,0s)}
.panel.on .rv{opacity:1;transform:none}

.stats{display:flex;gap:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,3rem);margin-top:2.3rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stats li{list-style:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,168,63,.45);padding-top:.95rem;min-width:112px}
.stats b{display:block;font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,2.6vw,2.4rem);color:var(--gold);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.stats b em{font-style:normal;font-size:.55em;margin-left:.15em;color:var(--gold-bright)}
.stats .lbl{display:block;margin-top:.35rem;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(244,236,216,.6)}

.chips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem;margin-top:2.1rem;max-width:460px}
.chips li{list-style:none;border:1px solid rgba(217,168,63,.35);background:rgba(5,23,16,.4);padding:.95rem 1.1rem;font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;display:flex;gap:.8em;align-items:center;transition:transform .35s,border-color .35s,background .35s}
.chips li::before{content:"◆";color:var(--gold);font-size:.6em}
.chips li:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:var(--gold);background:rgba(217,168,63,.14)}
@media(max-width:430px){.chips{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.7rem 1.6rem;margin-top:2.1rem;font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(244,236,216,.85)}
.tags span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8em;transition:color .3s}
.tags span::before{content:"◆";color:var(--red);font-size:.6em}
.tags span:hover{color:var(--gold-bright)}

.flavors{margin-top:2.2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.15rem;max-width:470px}
.flavor{display:grid;grid-template-columns:118px 1fr 36px;gap:1rem;align-items:center;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(244,236,216,.8)}
.flavor .bar{height:6px;background:rgba(244,236,216,.12);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.flavor .bar i{position:absolute;inset:0;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),var(--gold-bright));box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(217,168,63,.5);transition:width 1.3s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) .3s}
.panel.on .flavor .bar i{width:var(--w)}
.flavor b{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;color:var(--gold);font-size:1rem;text-align:right;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:430px){.flavor{grid-template-columns:88px 1fr 32px}}

.specs{margin-top:2.2rem;max-width:470px}
.specs div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,168,63,.3);padding:1rem 0;transition:padding-left .35s,background .35s}
.specs div:hover{padding-left:.8rem;background:rgba(217,168,63,.06)}
.specs dt{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;color:var(--gold);font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em}
.specs dd{font-size:.78rem;color:rgba(244,236,216,.72);text-align:right;letter-spacing:.06em}

/* ============ HERO ============ */
.hero{flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding-top:18vh}
.hero .inner{max-width:none}
.hero-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.1em;font-size:.64rem;letter-spacing:.44em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(244,236,216,.82);margin-bottom:2.4rem}
.hero-meta i{width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--red);transform:rotate(45deg);flex:none}
.wordmark{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(4.2rem,16.5vw,14.5rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:.02em;display:grid;margin-left:-.03em}
.wm{grid-area:1/1}
.wm.o{color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px rgba(217,168,63,.55);transform:translate(.05em,.055em)}
.wm.f{color:var(--cream);text-shadow:0 6px 90px rgba(217,168,63,.3)}
.hero-sub{margin-top:2.2rem;max-width:46ch;font-size:clamp(.98rem,1.3vw,1.15rem);line-height:1.85;color:rgba(244,236,216,.87)}
.hero-sub b{color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}
.badge{position:absolute;right:clamp(1rem,6vw,6rem);bottom:13vh;width:clamp(112px,13vw,172px);z-index:3}
.badge .spin{animation:spin 26s linear infinite;transform-origin:100px 100px}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
.badge text{fill:var(--gold);font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif}
.badge .bs{fill:var(--gold);font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700}
.badge .core{fill:none;stroke:rgba(217,168,63,.65);stroke-width:1}
@media(max-width:640px){.badge{display:none}}

/* ============ BURBUJAS ============ */
.bubbles{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden}
.bubbles i{position:absolute;bottom:-6%;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(242,205,107,.45);background:radial-gradient(circle at 32% 30%,rgba(244,236,216,.28),rgba(244,236,216,0) 62%);animation:rise linear infinite;will-change:transform}
@keyframes rise{0%{transform:translate(0,0)}100%{transform:translate(26px,-108vh);opacity:0}}

/* ============ FINAL ============ */
.salud{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(4rem,13vw,11rem);line-height:.95;color:var(--gold);text-shadow:0 0 100px rgba(217,168,63,.4)}
.cta-row{display:flex;gap:1rem;margin-top:2.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{position:relative;z-index:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:1.1em 2.3em;border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--gold);background:transparent;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;transition:color .4s}
.btn::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:var(--gold);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}
.btn:hover{color:var(--green-950)}
.btn:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
.btn.solid{background:var(--gold);color:var(--green-950)}
.btn.solid::before{background:var(--gold-bright)}

.marquee{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:56px;z-index:3;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,168,63,.3);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(217,168,63,.3);background:rgba(4,15,10,.5);overflow:hidden;padding:.95rem 0}
.marquee .lane{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:lane 28s linear infinite;white-space:nowrap}
.marquee .grp{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.32em;color:rgba(244,236,216,.88);margin-right:3rem}
.marquee .grp i{font-style:normal;color:var(--gold);margin-left:3rem}
@keyframes lane{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
.legal{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:1.2rem;z-index:3;text-align:center;font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(244,236,216,.45)}

/* ============ LOADER ============ */
#loader{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:100;background:radial-gradient(900px 620px at 50% 42%,#0d3323,#051710 76%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1.7rem;transition:opacity .8s,visibility .8s}
#loader.done{opacity:0;visibility:hidden}
#loader .mark{width:54px;height:54px;border:1px solid var(--gold);transform:rotate(45deg);display:grid;place-items:center;animation:pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite}
#loader .mark b{transform:rotate(-45deg);font-family:'Cinzel',serif;color:var(--gold);font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700}
@keyframes pulse{50%{box-shadow:0 0 34px rgba(217,168,63,.55)}}
#loader .lword{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;letter-spacing:.55em;color:var(--cream);font-size:.95rem;padding-left:.55em}
.lbar{width:230px;height:1px;background:rgba(244,236,216,.15)}
.lbar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--gold);transition:width .3s}
#loader small{font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(244,236,216,.55)}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .badge .spin,.marquee .lane,.hint .mouse::after,.grain,.bubbles i,#loader .mark{animation:none}
  .rv,.flavor .bar i{transition:none}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- LOADER -->
<div id="loader">
  <div class="mark"><b>S</b></div>
  <div class="lword">SINGHA</div>
  <div class="lbar"><i></i></div>
  <small>Cargando la leyenda · 0%</small>
</div>

<!-- ESCENARIO: VIDEO LIGADO AL SCROLL -->
<div class="stage" aria-hidden="true">
  <video id="film" src="https://andresweb26.com/videos/optimizado.mp4" muted playsinline preload="auto" disablepictureinpicture disableremoteplayback></video>
  <div class="stage-fallback"></div>
  <div class="tint"></div>
  <div class="vignette"></div>
  <div class="grain"></div>
</div>

<!-- UI FIJA -->
<div class="topfade"></div>
<div class="progress"><i id="progressFill"></i></div>
<header class="topbar">
  <a class="brand" href="#" id="brandTop"><i></i>SINGHA</a>
  <div class="top-right">
    <span id="chapterLabel">Intro</span>
    <span class="timecode"><span id="tcNow">00:00</span> / <span id="tcDur">--:--</span></span>
  </div>
</header>
<nav class="dots" id="dots" aria-label="Capítulos"></nav>
<div class="hint" id="hint"><span class="mouse"></span>Deslízate · el video sigue tu ritmo</div>
<div class="idx" id="idx"><b id="idxNum">01</b><span id="idxTitle">INTRO</span></div>

<!-- PISTA DE SCROLL -->
<main id="track">

  <!-- 1 · HERO -->
  <section class="panel hero" data-title="Intro">
    <div class="bubbles" data-n="14"></div>
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="hero-meta rv" style="--d:0s"><i></i>Cerveza premium · Est. 1933 · Bangkok, Tailandia</p>
      <h1 class="wordmark rv" style="--d:.1s" aria-label="SINGHA">
        <span class="wm o" aria-hidden="true">SINGHA</span>
        <span class="wm f">SINGHA</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub rv" style="--d:.3s">Noventa y tres años de leyenda dorada, condensados en un solo movimiento. <b>Cada capítulo se sirve al ritmo de tu scroll</b> — el video avanza, retrocede y se detiene contigo.</p>
    </div>
    <svg class="badge rv" style="--d:.5s" viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs><path id="cir" d="M100 100 m-78 0 a78 78 0 1 1 156 0 a78 78 0 1 1 -156 0"/></defs>
      <g class="spin"><text font-size="13" style="letter-spacing:3px"><textPath href="#cir">SINGHA · DESDE 1933 · EL LEÓN DORADO ·</textPath></text></g>
      <rect class="core" x="86" y="86" width="28" height="28" transform="rotate(45 100 100)"/>
      <text class="bs" x="100" y="108" text-anchor="middle">S</text>
    </svg>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 · EL ORIGEN -->
  <section class="panel" data-title="El origen">
    <div class="ghost" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="kicker rv" style="--d:0s">Capítulo 01 — El origen</p>
      <h2 class="rv" style="--d:.08s">1933.<br><span class="gold">Bangkok.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead rv" style="--d:.16s">En una Tailandia que soñaba en grande nace la primera cerveza del reino. No era una bebida más: era una declaración de orgullo nacional, elaborada con agua de manantial y una ambición dorada que todavía hoy se sirve en cada botella.</p>
      <ul class="stats rv" style="--d:.26s">
        <li><b><span data-count="1933">0</span></b><span class="lbl">Año fundacional</span></li>
        <li><b><span data-count="93">0</span></b><span class="lbl">Años de leyenda</span></li>
        <li><b><span data-count="100">0</span><em>%</em></b><span class="lbl">Tailandesa</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 · EL LEÓN -->
  <section class="panel right" data-title="El león">
    <div class="ghost" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="kicker rv" style="--d:0s">Capítulo 02 — El guardián</p>
      <h2 class="rv" style="--d:.08s">El león que <span class="gold">custodia</span> la receta</h2>
      <p class="lead rv" style="--d:.16s">Cuenta la leyenda que un león dorado protegía los manantiales sagrados de Siam. Su nombre: Singha. Su promesa: fuerza, nobleza y un carácter indomable en cada sorbo. El guardián nunca se fue — vive en la etiqueta, en el relieve y en quien se atreve a brindar.</p>
      <p class="note rv" style="--d:.26s"><span class="thai">สิงห์</span> · «Singha» significa león en tailandés</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 · INGREDIENTES -->
  <section class="panel" data-title="Ingredientes">
    <div class="ghost" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="kicker rv" style="--d:0s">Capítulo 03 — Los ingredientes</p>
      <h2 class="rv" style="--d:.08s">Cuatro elementos.<br><span class="gold">Una obsesión.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead rv" style="--d:.16s">Nada entra en la botella sin antes demostrar que merece estar. Agua purificada de manantial, malta seleccionada grano a grano, lúpulo aromático y una levadura propia guardada bajo llave desde 1933.</p>
      <ul class="chips rv" style="--d:.26s">
